# Cloudflare Pages: extra response headers.
#
# PREVIEW ONLY: keeps the unfinished site (*.pages.dev) out of Google.
# Phase 9 (launch): DELETE the "X-Robots-Tag" line below when the real domain goes live.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
